# Text is stored and checked out with LF on every machine, whatever
# core.autocrlf says, so git never converts line endings (and never warns that
# it will). Windows tools here (Rust, Python, PowerShell, the game's resource
# reader via the packaging scripts) all accept LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assembled payloads are machine code; never convert their line endings.
*.bin binary
